      "text": "Contrave:"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " weight loss may raise hypoglycemia risk on insulin and/or secretagogues (eg, SUs); check BG before and during tx and consider lowering non-glucose-dependent antidiabetic doses."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
